# SynesisOne Kanon Solana Program Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains a historical public Solana program audit report completed by Softstack for SynesisOne.

SynesisOne is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a Solana program security reference connected to Web3 data, AI and decentralized application infrastructure.

## Audit Information

Project: SynesisOne  
Audit type: Solana program audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Report

[02_Programs_Audit_SynesisOne_Kanon_Solana.pdf](./02_Programs_Audit_SynesisOne_Kanon_Solana.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed Solana program security work.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s program audit work connected to Solana, Web3 data infrastructure, AI related crypto applications and decentralized application security.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
